    {
      "id": "IK-52547606:L89",
      "source_document": "52547606",
      "original_line": 89,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has pointed out that the judgment relied upon by the RCT in Civil Revision No. CM (M) No. 642/2010 Page 7 of 21 1877/1987 Ram Sarup (deceased) represented by Harish Kumar & Another VS. Lal Chand & Others is a half page judgment which judgment was at best per-incuriam; it is not a ratio which can per-se be made applicable to the present case.",
      "provenance": [
        {
