    {
      "id": "IK-52547606:L91",
      "source_document": "52547606",
      "original_line": 91,
      "text": "The submission of the respondent being that ground under cite10†Section 14 (1)(b) was not established; further submission being that the present petition has even otherwise been filed in the year 1973 when admittedly even as per the case of the petitioner, the sub-tenancy was created in the year 1950; bar of limitation is also applicable. To support this submission reliance has been placed upon cite15†AIR 1987 SC 2016 Ganpat Ram Sharma and Others VS. Smt. Gayatri Devi , AIR 1987 SC 2230 Kashi Ram Vs.",
      "provenance": [
